---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = "FHA Loans in Miami, Florida | Mortgage Broker Miami Florida";
const description = "Compare FHA loan options in Miami, including lower down payment FHA mortgages, condo considerations, credit flexibility, loan limits and preapproval help.";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<main id="main"><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">FHA mortgage options</p><h1>FHA Loans in Miami, Florida</h1><p>Compare FHA loan options in Miami, including lower down payment FHA mortgages, condo considerations, credit flexibility, loan limits and preapproval help.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="start.html">Start Mortgage Review</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="get-preapproved-miami.html">Get Preapproved</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="mortgage-calculator-florida.html">Calculate Payment</a></div><div class="trust-row"><span class="trust-pill">Matthew Gromadzki</span><span class="trust-pill">NMLS #2560919</span><span class="trust-pill">Miami · Florida</span></div></div><form class="lead-form"><h2>Request a FHA Loans Miami, Florida Quote</h2><p>Answer a few basics and we’ll review the best mortgage path for your scenario.</p><label>Loan goal<select><option>Select one</option><option>Buying a home</option><option>Refinancing</option><option>Condo financing</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Purchase price / value<input placeholder="$650,000"></label><label>Down payment / equity<input placeholder="$100,000"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Credit score range<select><option>Select range</option><option>760+</option><option>720–759</option><option>680–719</option><option>640–679</option></select></label><label>Property city<input placeholder="Miami"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Name<input></label><label>Phone<input></label></div><label>Email<input type="email"></label><button class="btn btn-primary full" type="button">Start Mortgage Review</button></form></div></section><section class="section "><div class="container two-col"><article class="prose"><h2>Who FHA loans can help in Miami</h2><p>FHA loans are commonly used by first-time home buyers, buyers with limited down payment savings, and borrowers who want a more flexible approval path.</p><h2>Miami condo FHA considerations</h2><p>Not every condo project is eligible for FHA financing. Confirm whether the building is FHA-approved or whether another approval path may be possible before making an offer.</p><h2>FHA vs conventional</h2><p>FHA should be compared against conventional financing using payment, mortgage insurance, cash to close, property type, and condo eligibility.</p><ul class="check-grid"><li>Payment estimate</li><li>Cash to close</li><li>Property review</li><li>Documentation checklist</li></ul></article><aside><div class="content-card"><h2>Related loan pages</h2><ul><li><a href="mortgage-broker-miami.html">Mortgage Broker Miami</a></li><li><a href="get-preapproved-miami.html">Get Preapproved</a></li><li><a href="miami-mortgage-rates.html">Mortgage Rates</a></li><li><a href="mortgage-calculator-florida.html">Calculator</a></li></ul></div></aside></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Can I get a personalized quote?</summary><p>Yes. Send property type, price/value, down payment/equity, credit range, city, occupancy and income type.</p></details><details><summary>Is approval guaranteed?</summary><p>No. Final approval depends on underwriting, documentation, property review and lender guidelines.</p></details><details><summary>Should I start before making an offer?</summary><p>Yes. Miami property type and condo/building review can affect the loan path before contract deadlines.</p></details></div></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
